    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94d5db89aeda0231e87107f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为他们顺从自己的心意行动，\n我才会在这里。那对过去的他们来说，\n肯定是一段没有留下遗憾的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4ce93442de74d0809e3b0fa2ed9c2f7753311e1a0820b28114e0b2e14df989f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ab581d6c3877bc8de4aff08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这对父母真的很爱自己的女儿。\n所以，身为她的签约训练员，\n我感受到一股沉重的责任感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccd43ccefcc339b3345010be4ecec96463e354a6a23a800e01126d5fd729cefe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d22d9476f9c10e7f8f5cdd7c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她曾因为坚持自己的信念，\n而多次跟别人产生冲突。\n她的父母一定比任何人都更常目睹那样的景象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8184cc5613b535de45c0b5b35fbd8db9b27b42b75bca8d299c3d2dfbdfdd2089",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17f654ba146ca6a86b90efdc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一定会让她绽放光辉",
      "source_fingerprint": "639378ee81f83873f02265b38560408243e27c6e17631d094534b0926515a2b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62c51adee281e0e02a5296d7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下次请来看她的比赛",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe58c44561f286025103633ab0c40ebcb8f3a41466384bcfdf4ded924670021e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
