    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecef913a9e473def0ce8bd3c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈……我爸爸好像希望有人晚上能陪他喝酒。\n你不介意的话，就陪他一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d31ecb27f70d22cf6537ebe5ed2731a4de982a3de0923dc01368063ca9b2859",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
